L0069 style=fg=-,bg=-,mod=- align=-
  s00 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- "The row grows to fit the tallest image in it, and a cell holding both an image and text stacks"
  s01 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " "
  s02 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- "them, image first. Anything that cannot be drawn — a missing file, a fetch still in flight, a"
  s03 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " "
  s04 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- "terminal with no image protocol — keeps the "
  s05 fg=white,bg=-,mod=- "🖼 alt"
  s06 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " label."
