  s02 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " "
  s03 fg=-,bg=-,mod=B "onto their own line"
  s04 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " and drawn as images ("
  s05 fg=white,bg=-,mod=- "[ui] math"
  s06 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- "). Display math is centered:"
L0139 style=fg=-,bg=-,mod=- align=-
  s00 fg=-,bg=-,mod=D "$$ \\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} e^{-x^2}\\,dx = \\sqrt{\\pi} $$"
L0140 style=fg=-,bg=-,mod=- align=-
  s00 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- "Currency ("
  s01 fg=white,bg=-,mod=- "$5"
  s02 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " and "
  s03 fg=white,bg=-,mod=- "$10"
  s04 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- "), "
  s05 fg=white,bg=-,mod=- "`$x$`"
  s06 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " inside code, and escaped "
  s07 fg=white,bg=-,mod=- "\\$"
  s08 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " are never mistaken for"
  s09 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " "
  s10 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- "math. RaTeX (pure Rust, KaTeX quality) rasterizes them, so no browser or Node is needed."
  s11 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " "
  s12 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- "Set "
  s13 fg=white,bg=-,mod=- "math = \"text\""
  s14 fg=-,bg=-,mod=- " to show the raw LaTeX instead."
